    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάκελλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enclosure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				42(1).102.107
			</span></i>, al. (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>):— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάκελλος</span></b> , ὁ, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				137
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάκελος</span></b> , ὁ, and pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακέλα</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάκελλα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάκελλος</span></b> , ὁ, = Lat. <i>macellum, market,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(2).268.45
			</span></i> (Mantinea, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				5(1).149
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Sparta</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				10.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				61.18
			</span></i>, <i>PLond,ined.</i><i><span class="en">
				2487.43
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακελλάριος</span></b> , ὁ,
				= Lat. <i>macellarius</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				134
			</span></i>; =
			<i>laniator, lanio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>: neut.</div>
